    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνερύω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνειρύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά θ᾽ ἱστία λεύκ᾽ ἐρύσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.77
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				12.402
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνειρύσαι νῆας,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελκύσαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.96
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.586
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πέπλως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					14.35
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ νούσου ἀνειρύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.300
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
